Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(ui): restyle public website - deep-blue hero, brand
 mark, token-based footer and auth panels

- Home hero uses the shared hero gradient; CTAs follow the AA-safe pairing.
- PublicLayout/Login/Register use BrandMark instead of the wifi icon.
- Footer, ContactUs and auth side panel use design tokens instead of raw hex.
